<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1,viewport-fit=cover">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#260e24">
<title>Six Years of Us ♡</title>
<link id="site-styles" rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head><body>
<div class="wrap">
<header class="nav">
<div class="brand">♡ &nbsp; SIX YEARS</div>
<nav class="navlinks" aria-label="Main navigation"><a href="#memories">Our story</a><a href="#games">Play</a><a href="#surprise">Surprise</a></nav></header>
<main>
<section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
<div>
<div class="eyebrow">A little universe for two</div>
<h1 id="hero-title">Six years.<br><em>Still you.</em></h1>
<p id="greeting"></p>
<p class="date" id="anniversary-date" hidden></p>
<div class="actions"><a class="btn primary" href="#memories">Discover our story <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a><a class="btn secondary" href="#games">Play with me ♡</a></div></div>
<div class="hero-art" aria-hidden="true"><span class="spark a">✧</span><span class="spark b">✦</span><span class="spark c">✧</span>
<div class="orbit">
<div class="heart-art">♥</div></div><span class="art-caption">Every day, my favorite person</span></div></section>
<section class="section" id="memories">
<div class="section-head">
<div class="eyebrow">01 / Our love story</div>
<h2>Six chapters of us.</h2>
<p>Some moments become memories. Some memories become a whole life together. Here's to every chapter we have shared.</p></div>
<div class="timeline" id="timeline"></div></section>
<section class="section" id="games">
<div class="section-head">
<div class="eyebrow">02 / A little adventure</div>
<h2>Let's play, my love.</h2>
<p>Two tiny games, one big surprise. Complete both to unlock a secret letter made just for you.</p></div>
<div class="games">
<article class="game">
<div class="eyebrow">Game 01</div>
<h3>Match our hearts</h3>
<p>Turn over two cards at a time. Find all six matching pairs.</p>
<div class="status"><span id="match-count">0 / 6 pairs</span><span id="moves">0 moves</span></div>
<div class="match-grid" id="match-grid" aria-label="Memory matching cards"></div>
<div class="game-footer">
<button class="btn secondary" id="reset-match">Shuffle again</button></div>
<p class="game-message" id="match-message" aria-live="polite"></p></article>
<article class="game">
<div class="eyebrow">Game 02</div>
<h3>Catch my love</h3>
<p>Catch 10 little hearts in 25 seconds. They won't stay still for long!</p>
<div class="status"><span id="catch-count">0 / 10 hearts</span><span id="timer">25s</span></div>
<div class="field" id="field"><span class="field-msg" id="field-msg">Ready to catch my heart? ♡</span>
<button class="target" id="target" aria-label="Catch a heart" hidden>♥</button></div>
<div class="game-footer">
<button class="btn primary" id="start-catch">Start game</button></div>
<p class="game-message" id="catch-message" aria-live="polite"></p></article></div></section>
<section class="section" id="surprise">
<div class="section-head">
<div class="eyebrow">03 / Just for you</div>
<h2>One last surprise.</h2></div>
<div class="letter-wrap">
<div class="lock-symbol" id="lock-symbol" aria-hidden="true">♡</div>
<h2 id="letter-heading">A letter from my heart.</h2>
<p id="lock-text" aria-live="polite">Your secret message is waiting. Finish the two games to open it.</p>
<div class="actions">
<button class="btn primary" id="open-letter" disabled>🔒 Unlock my letter</button><a href="#games" class="btn secondary" id="back-games">Back to games</a></div>
<div id="letter-paper" class="letter-paper hidden" tabindex="-1">
<h3 id="letter-title"></h3>
<p id="letter-text"></p>
<p class="signature" id="signature"></p></div></div></section></main>
<footer class="footer"><span>Made with love. ♡ &nbsp; Six years and counting.</span>
<button class="edit-link" id="edit-button">Personalize this website</button></footer></div>
<dialog id="editor">
<form id="edit-form">
<h2>Make it yours.</h2>
<p class="edit-note">Add real memories, photos and a personal letter. Download your personalized copy to share. Everything stays in this browser until you export the file.</p>
<div class="edit-row"><label>Your name<input id="edit-from" maxlength="80"></label><label>Your partner's name<input id="edit-to" maxlength="80"></label></div><label>Anniversary date (optional)<input id="edit-date" type="date"></label><label>Welcome message<textarea id="edit-greeting" maxlength="600"></textarea></label><label>Secret love letter<textarea id="edit-letter" rows="8" maxlength="5000"></textarea></label>
<div id="edit-memories"></div>
<div class="actions">
<button class="btn primary" type="submit" id="export">Save &amp; download website</button>
<button class="btn secondary" type="button" id="close-editor">Close</button></div>
<p class="edit-note" id="edit-status" aria-live="polite"></p></form></dialog>
